{
  "name": "Circle of Peace",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can conduct a magical ritual that wards off those that would do you and your companions harm. You have to spend 8 hours during downtime before a rest to prepare the ritual. You and your companions do not suffer a random combat encounter during the night. If a combat encounter happens through different circumstances, none of you can be Surprised and are automatically woken at the start of combat.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier and regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
